Package: whykey
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: explain where a Linux key combination is handled
 Whykey diagnoses the path of a keyboard event through Linux desktops,
 terminals, TTYs, multiplexers, shells, and supported applications.
 It is read-only and never executes the shortcut under investigation.
